<title>NETHERLANDS: CSFB remote member of Amsterdam Exchanges.</title>
<headline>CSFB remote member of Amsterdam Exchanges.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Amsterdam Exchanges said on Thursday that brokerage CS First Boston (Europe) Ltd had been taking part in share trading on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange as a so-called 'remote member' since May 14.</p>
<p>This raises the number of remote members, who do not have a branch in the Netherlands but have a direct connection to Amsterdam's share trading system, to six.</p>
<p>Including foreign institutions dealing in options, futures and bonds, the number of remote members of the Amsterdam Exchanges now totals 46.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
